# protobuf/

Protobuf definitions for the Udex service API. Defines three main services: IndexService (index configuration), EntryService (key-context mappings), and HealthzService (health checks). These are the wire contracts between client and server.

## Files

- `udex.index.v1.proto` -- Index service for creating and managing indices with configurable constraints and hash algorithms
- `udex.entry.v1.proto` -- Entry service for creating/deleting key-context mappings and bulk read/write operations
- `udex.healthz.v1.proto` -- Health check service for server status monitoring
